{"name":"Booger Buster","hex":"#00ff77","fetched":"2026-10-11","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"booger","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A piece of solid or semisolid mucus in or removed from a nostril.","Something suggestive of this material."]},{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A bodyboarder."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/booger"},{"term":"buster","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Someone who or something that bursts, breaks, or destroys a specified thing.","Forming compounds denoting a team, weapon, or device specialized in the destruction of the first element."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/buster"}],"entries":[{"title":"Nose picking","blocks":[{"text":"Nose picking (rhinotillexis) is the act of extracting dried nasal mucus from the nostrils with one's finger. In Western cultures, performing this act in public is generally considered to be socially deviant; parents and pediatricians have historically tried to prevent development of the habit and attempt to break it if already established. The practice is nearly universal."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3d/Ni%C3%B1a_pem%C3%B3n_-_La_Gran_Sabana_-_Estado_Bol%C3%ADvar_%282%29.JPG/330px-Ni%C3%B1a_pem%C3%B3n_-_La_Gran_Sabana_-_Estado_Bol%C3%ADvar_%282%29.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nose_picking","wikidata":"Q119770"}],"images":[],"sounds":{"booger":[{"type":"audio/wav","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/89/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-StalJosA-Booger.wav?utm_source=en.wiktionary.org&utm_campaign=rest&utm_content=original"},{"type":"audio/mpeg","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/8/89/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-StalJosA-Booger.wav/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-StalJosA-Booger.wav.mp3"},{"type":"audio/ogg; codecs=\"vorbis\"","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/8/89/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-StalJosA-